<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Caribbean Fury #3 Rumble in the Jungle, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY text=#dcdcdc bgColor=#2b2b2b scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Caribbean Fury 3:&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Rumble in the Jungle &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;17 Feb 1994, 0600 Zulu, 0100 Local&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;This is the&amp;nbsp;third scenario of a short campaign linked to the Northern Fury series and you may wish to refer to that background &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;A href="http://northernfury.us/blog/post19/" target=_BLANK&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-CA style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;document&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt; to get a broader picture of the geopolitical setting.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The situation in the Caribbean is somewhat unique in that it is a small ‘side show’ to the great events occurring in Europe, the North Atlantic and Pacific. However, it is of vital interest to NATO’s largest partner – the US, and also important to the British, Dutch and French, all holding on to the vestiges of their colonial empires.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The American government and military commanders want to quickly stabilize the situation here and get on with fighting the real war. The British want to prevent a protracted insurgency in Belize, while the French and Dutch want the other two to focus on the largest threat to their territory – Venezuela. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;The Soviets however have other ideas and want to use the situation and their proxies to distract and tie down as many US forces as possible, for as long as possible. Cuba has essentially been knocked out of the war already, the raid on Castro’s Hacienda either killed him or forced him into hiding, the Dictator has not been seen in 36 hours and a pro-piece, but not necessarily pro-American government has taken power and called for a cease fire.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;See the &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;A href="http://northernfury.us/blog/post20/" target=_BLANK&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-CA style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;Caribbean Fury background document&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt; for further insight on the background and specific issues in the Caribbean.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;In this third scenario you have two main tasks: The American focus is to knock Honduras and Nicaragua out of the war; the British focus, aided by the French and Dutch as well as others is to stabilize the situation in Belize and deliver knock-out blows to the Guatemalan backed insurgents without bringing Guatemala into the war.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Background&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;UL type=disc&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The Cold War continued with no thaw in relations. Germany’s reunification has caused friction between East &amp;amp; West. WP still alive and doing very well. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The Winter Olympics in Lillehammer turned into a fiasco when Soviet and eastern block teams failed to turn up for the opening ceremonies. Norway canceled the games and after some deliberation started to mobilize.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;War broke out across the globe around mid day on Sunday 13 Feb 94. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;In the Caribbean, Cuba, Honduras and Nicaragua joined the fray, somewhat haphazardly but for the first 18 hours had US and limited NATO forces off balance.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;However, over the past days the situation has stabilized.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Cuba, reinforced by some high end Soviet aircraft and SAM systems launched a devastating raid on Key West.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Although there was some initial success, revenge was swift and a new government in Havana has called for a cease fire. Negotiations are ongoing but Cuban airspace is closed for NATO forces to allow the settlement to be finalized.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;Designer’s notes&lt;/B&gt;:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;You should turn 'special messages' ON.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;You will generally not get points for destroying units in this scenario, although there are some exceptions. That doesn’t mean inflicting casualties is not necessary, those casualties are tracked and will lead to other events happening. Completing missions and achieving objectives will gain you points and some of those objectives are secondary effects of enemy casualties.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;NATO losses will not only affect your points but will impact other hidden tracks. For instance, if you lose a ship, you will lose points but worse – both Honduras and Nicaragua will claim a naval victory and tout it in their local press – giving them a boost in national prestige. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;This scenario makes heavy use of the Cargo module in CMO&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;This scenario is built with angsters excellent Search and Rescue script as modified by TyphoonFR.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: black"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: black"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin; AKA Gunner 98&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
